  "description": "OWUYEM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group I 2/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H100 Fe4 N16 O25 Tb4 Zn4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 5 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.393-5.038 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.61-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C120H100Fe4N16O25Tb4Zn4.",
